From fd8b1923b1ea9618d0f22582c90f63a2a7fff7b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kamil Monicz <kamil@monicz.dev>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:54:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build pinned PROJ with static resources and exact CRS
 semantics

Based on the published proj-sys 0.27.0 crate (b035b3c588c3b07ac462262126a37b216d3a37d8). Build pinned PROJ 9.9.0 with matching host and wasm32 bindings, static SQLite, libtiff and zlib, and shared native compiler configuration. Apply the source fixes under patches/proj and expose the fresh context and exact angular-unit hooks used by Gometry. Reuse the current bindings for nobuild instead of retaining a separate obsolete docs.rs copy. The upstream bundled archive is stored at vendor/proj instead of inside the sys crate; development-only upstream metadata is omitted from the vendored payload.
---
